name: sim.getJointDependency
description: Retrieves joint dependency information, when the joint is in dependent mode
luaSynopsis: int masterJointHandle, float offset, float multCoeff = sim.getJointDependency(int jointHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int masterJointHandle, float offset, float multCoeff = sim.getJointDependency(int jointHandle)
inputs:
1. jointHandle: handle of the slave joint
outputs:
1. masterJointHandle: handle of the master joint, or -1 if the joint is not dependent
2. offset: offset in equation slave = offset + master * multCoeff
3. multCoeff: coeff in equation slave = offset + master * multCoeff
